[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; The pause menu. Inherits ModalPanel.tscn and adds three buttons. Replaces
; GameplayHud.CreatePausePanel.
;
; Subtitle is the save confirmation line - what CreatePausePanel called PauseStatus. It is written
; in place by ShowPauseSaved rather than shown as a timed toast, because this menu runs at
; TimeScale 0 where a scaled SceneTreeTimer never fires and a toast would hang there forever.
; SetPauseVisible clears it on every open.
;
; 0.88 rather than the base's 0.92: the pause menu is the one panel the player is expected to close
; again, and the world staying faintly readable behind it is the difference between paused and over.
;
; Every button's text is a localisation key; Godot translates a Control's text through the same
; ui.csv table Tr() reads, so no Korean literal appears here or in the script.
;
; UNITS: screen pixels.

